       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-DISTRIB-ZORSE-STRATEGIES.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TF-DISTRIBUTED-STRATEGIES.
           05  WS-MIRRORED-STRAT-SYNC-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PARAMETER-SERVER-RING-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TPU-POD-SCSI-ARRAY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ALLREDUCE-BESSEL-PEACE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BMRC-REDUCTION-BOUND     PIC 9(03)V9(03) VALUE 000.875.
       01  WS-STRATEGY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-DISTRIB-STRAT-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DISTRIB-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MIRRORED-STRATEGY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PARAM-SERVER-AND-TPU.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-ALLREDUCE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MIRRORED-STRATEGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MIRRORED-STRAT-SYNC-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PARAM-SERVER-AND-TPU.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PARAMETER-SERVER-RING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TPU-POD-SCSI-ARRAY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-ALLREDUCE.
           IF WS-MIRRORED-STRAT-SYNC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PARAMETER-SERVER-RING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TPU-POD-SCSI-ARRAY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ALLREDUCE-BESSEL-PEACE = 1 AND
              WS-BMRC-REDUCTION-BOUND >= 000.875
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DISTRIB-STRAT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DISTRIB-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-DISTRIB-STRAT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DISTRIB-CODE.
